### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### =========================================================================
### 1. ORIGINAL METHOD: Standard Get Todos (Synchronous TCP)
### =========================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

### =========================================================================
### 2. ORIGINAL METHOD: Create Todo (TCP + Redis Pub/Sub intact!)
### =========================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Fault Tolerance in Microservices"
}

### =========================================================================
### 3. 🛡️ RESILIENT METHOD: Resilient Get (Normal / Fast)
### Has 2s timeout protection active behind the scenes
### =========================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/resilient
Content-Type: application/json

### =========================================================================
### 4. ⏱️ RESILIENT METHOD: Resilient Get with SLOW SIMULATION (Hangs 5s)
### Watch the 2000ms timeout trigger and return a Graceful Fallback!
### =========================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/resilient?slow=true
Content-Type: application/json

### =========================================================================
### 5. 🎯 ERROR HANDLING: Get Todo by ID (Found)
### =========================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

### =========================================================================
### 6. 🎯 ERROR HANDLING: Get Todo by ID (Not Found -> RpcException 404)
### =========================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/999
Content-Type: application/json

### =========================================================================
### 7. DTO VALIDATION: Title too short (< 3 chars) -> HTTP 400
### =========================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "No"
}

### =========================================================================
### 8. 📬 NEW CHAPTER: PUSH PERSISTENT JOB TO BULLMQ QUEUE
### Pushes job into Redis. Survived even if Worker is offline!
### =========================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos/queue/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "mazharul@example.com",
  "subject": "Order Confirmation #1001",
  "body": "Thank you for your order! This job is safely stored in BullMQ."
}

### =========================================================================
### 9. 🔍 NEW CHAPTER: CHECK QUEUE STATUS & JOB COUNTS
### Returns counts of 'waiting', 'active', 'completed', 'failed' jobs
### =========================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/queue/status
Content-Type: application/json
